-/// between calls to keep one call's reads ahead of the next call's writes.
+/// Implemented as a shared-memory Hillis-Steele scan: the subgroup (plane) scan
+/// used previously compiles to WGSL subgroup operations, which require a device
+/// capability that is missing on some Android GPUs (e.g. Adreno 650 through this
+/// wgpu build). This version is portable everywhere.
